      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752691309110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Clean data\n- Normalize features (model sensitive to feature magnitude)\n- Watch out for multicollinearity\n- Start simple (use few meaningful features)\n\nNote on p-values:\n- they only measure relationships beetween one input variable and the output\n- not between input variables themselves",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Clean data\n- Normalize features (model sensitive to feature magnitude)\n- Watch out for multicollinearity\n- Start simple (use few meaningful features)\n\nNote on p-values:\n- they only measure relationships beetween one input variable and the output\n- not between input variables themselves",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
