      "updated": 1752697048558,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Look beyond accuracy\n- use Confusion Matrices to understand what types of errors\n   the model makes\n- for Binary Classification, examine precision, recall, and F1-score\n- ROC curve and AUC score tell you about the model's\n   discrimination ability across different thresholds",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Look beyond accuracy\n- use Confusion Matrices to understand what types of errors\n   the model makes\n- for Binary Classification, examine precision, recall, and F1-score\n- ROC curve and AUC score tell you about the model's\n   discrimination ability across different thresholds",
